sentence_before:
\subsubsection{Phase 2 : GAN-Guided Conditional U-Net and Diffusion Optimization}
\label{sec:ddim}
Both diffusion U-Nets share a U-Net backbone incorporating FiLM-style timestep conditioning \cite{perez2018film}, bottleneck self-attention, and cross-attention blocks where U-Net spatial features attend to a fixed WGAN-GP feature map ($g$) computed once per sampling chain.

sentence_after:
\subsubsection{Phase 2 : GAN-Guided Conditional U-Net and Diffusion Optimization}
\label{sec:ddim}
Both diffusion U-Nets share a U-Net backbone integrating FiLM-style timestep conditioning \cite{perez2018film}, bottleneck self-attention, and cross-attention blocks where U-Net spatial features attend to a fixed WGAN-GP feature map ($g$) computed once per sampling chain.

